"""Keep authored class devices distinct from unreviewed crafted-device formulas."""
from pathlib import Path
import json,hashlib
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];GAME=ROOT.parents[1];AUDIT=GAME/'docs/audit/2026-10-08/full-game'
def read(p):return json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))
def sha(p):return hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
def create(p,s):
    with p.open('x',encoding='utf-8',newline='\n') as f:f.write(s)
CASES=[
 ('TD-01','Class ownership versus crafted output','A level1 Tinker automatically owns one Anacite Drone,while a purchased formula output may be a Tiny/Small automaton. Decide eligibility for every class benefit independently; preserve source identities,construction costs,automatic grants and missing crafted stats. A common word does not make these the same item.'),
 ('TD-02','Command budgets across both sources','One Tinker controls class drones/turrets/scraplings and two crafted machines. Resolve which enter the one damaging action per Bonus Action command per regular turn,which require another procedure,and non-Tinker control. Do not invent autonomous attacks or silently remove a separately promised crafted function.'),
 ('TD-03','Class cap versus physical inventory','Dual Drone Protocols permits at most2 class drones and separately bounded deployable slots. Determine whether crafted companions consume either cap,their own cap or a distinct resource. Account for actual carried bodies,stowed machines,transfer and owner changes without converting a printed class limit into unlimited minions.'),
 ('TD-04','Class attack profiles versus missing recipe fields','Eighteen ordinary craft automatons print AC/HP/encounter counts but no complete attack/Speed profile. Decide their missing values from source/interface review; never copy the Anacite1d6 piercing,flight30,Shock,immunities orPB+INT profile merely because both are constructs.'),
 ('TD-05','Modules and hardware eligibility','Apply Burn Injector,Poison Vents,Concussive Bolt,shield,smoke andsupport modules only after defining which physical devices can receive them. Preserve the class module-slot schedule,swap timing,hard-denial guard and command costs. A crafted Psychic attack or source tag does not automatically count as a class bolt.'),
 ('TD-06','Mechanical Aptitude and actual trade tasks','The selected class card grants advantage to understand,repair ordisable mechanisms with tools/access. Decide how this applies to real crafting,identification,servicing,salvaging and rune work without broadening it to every INT check. Proficiency and recipe access remain separate.'),
 ('TD-07','Field Repair and intact versus destroyed machinery','The class card costs1RP,Recharge2,restoresS d8+M to a functional damaged construct/device and cannot revive destroyed objects or refill uses. Determine which crafted bodies qualify and their HP classification. Preserve the narrower class-drone reconstruction route versus each recipe-specific repair procedure.'),
 ('TD-08','Protected Dissonance routing','The existing class interface routes up to2 Dissonance into one active device once per short rest,disabling it while duration ticks. Decide which crafted devices count as yours andactive,ownership/transfer behavior and restoration. It creates no RP and resets no counters; cheap or temporary bodies must not silently create a new repeatable resource loop.'),
 ('TD-09','Jury-rig and enhancement arbitration','Jury-rig gives+1 first attack/turn or+5feet device movement for3rounds,one modification per item. Decide legal crafted targets and which enhancement family applies. A device that uses a save but makes no attack does not gain an attack roll by implication; unchanged command limits remain explicit.'),
 ('TD-10','Gadget Sync and priced extra actions','A class bomb can trigger one turret shot under Gadget Sync,which replaces its normal commanded damaging action. Decide eligibility for a crafted gun,trap,drone orsiege device and whether any has an ordinary shot. No new bomb,chain or additional Bonus Action attack may be inferred from shared names.'),
 ('TD-11','Technical Mastery and explosive profiles','The class feature pays1RP after its d10 trigger to add half unmodified damage dice to one target. Determine eligible crafted damaging activations and interactions with trap saves,bursts,12d10 siege andSiege Savant. It creates no second activation,commands,procs,resources orhealing.'),
 ('TD-12','Servicing versus class repair and rests','Craft automatons function forN encounters before servicing; class drone repair explicitly does not recharge devices. Define whether servicing,repair,class Long Rest rebuild,short rests anddawn are distinct clocks. Fix out-of-combat operation and prevent alternating repair/transfer from refreshing a spent budget.'),
 ('TD-13','Efficient Recycling and actual RP paid','A crafted device costgp to build but noRP to deploy; another activation spentRP. Decide whether either qualifies for recovering1RP,never above actual deployment cost. Preserve enemy-destruction/own-device/debris conditions and no deliberate sacrifice or copy. Monetary value is not RP credit.'),
 ('TD-14','One debris identity across three systems','Efficient Recycling,Scrap Salvage,Scrap Reaper andmundane Salvaging all encounter the same destroyed body. Decide exclusive claims and residual matter before resolution. Consumed debris cannot also become a recovered component,second Scrapling,rebuilt original orsaleable intact body.'),
 ('TD-15','Field Fabrication and permanent ingredients','The class makes temporary ordinary tools for1hour with no cash value,rare material,magic item orpermanent structure. Decide whether they can serve as a reusable tool during an order and whether any may be incorporated as consumed stock or supplemental bodies. Expiration and mass accounting cannot be omitted.'),
 ('TD-16','Mech Overdrive and persistent crafted items','The level20 capstone extends one newly deployed device to encounter end,max1minute,without recharge orpermanent equipment. Determine which crafted output can have a duration extended and what happens to an ordinary persistent body. Preserve pulse caps,slots,command costs andspent charges.'),
 ('TD-17','Command Drone authority','Recipe686 coordinates up to3 constructs/mechanisms within120feet. Decide whether it can issue class commands,control enemy hardware,relay instructions orchange a budget; define contested ownership andaction requirements. Its explicit Silent Ones/Heartcell prohibition remains literal and unchanged; no cosmology interpretation.'),
 ('TD-18','Class,feat andrecipe creation routes','Class bombs andField Fabrication have no resale/stockpiling benefits; Tinkering recipes andpending Crafting feats have separate materials,work,quality andsale rules. Provide precise cross-route eligibility without converting free class inventory into sellable permanent recipe outputs or treating pending feats as approved.')]
def main():
    out=AUDIT/'TINKER_DEVICE_INTERFACE_PREPARATION.json';notes=AUDIT/'TINKER_DEVICE_INTERFACE_AUDIT.md';packet=AUDIT/'CODEX_TINKER_DEVICE_INTERFACE_PREPARED.txt';assert not out.exists() and not notes.exists() and not packet.exists()
    classpath=ROOT/'data/public/class_playtests/tinker.json';c=read(classpath);guidepath=ROOT/'docs/mechanics/classes/tinker.md';guide=guidepath.read_text(encoding='utf-8');extractpath=ROOT/'data/playtest/class_sources/tinker.json';extract=read(extractpath);bookpath=GAME/extract['sourcePath'];booklines=bookpath.read_text(encoding='utf-8').splitlines()
    check=[]
    def test(name,ok):check.append({'name':name,'pass':bool(ok)})
    test('All48 class cards remain unique andcomplete',len(c['cards'])==48 and len({r['id'] for r in c['cards']})==48 and all(r['effect'] and r['activation'] and r['cost'] for r in c['cards']))
    test('Class extract retains exact underlying book hash',sha(bookpath)==extract['sourceSha256']==c['sourceExtractSha256'])
    test('All210 indexed original book lines still match',len(extract['bookLines'])==210 and all(booklines[r['line']-1]==r['text'] for r in extract['bookLines']))
    test('All48 authored effects appear in class guide',all(r['effect'] in guide for r in c['cards']))
    test('Eight complete class-engine paragraphs appear in guide',len(c['engine'])==8 and all(p in guide for p in c['engine']))
    sourcepath=ROOT/'data/crafting/Decennium_Descent_Crafting_Bible_v4.json';recipes=[r for r in read(sourcepath)['recipes'] if r['skill']=='Tinkering'];prep=read(AUDIT/'ADVANCED_CRAFT_SOURCE_PREPARATION.json');prepared=[r for r in prep['recipes'] if r['skill']=='Tinkering']
    test('All43 craft originals equal already prepared source evidence',len(recipes)==43 and recipes==prepared and sha(sourcepath)==prep['sourceSha256'])
    catalog=read(ROOT/'data/director/crafting_recipe_review_catalog.json');rows=[r for r in catalog['recipes'] if r['trade']=='Tinkering']
    test('All43 recipes still source-only,not exact reviewed',len(rows)==43 and all(r['status']=='source-only-unreviewed' for r in rows))
    cmanifest=read(ROOT/'docs/mechanics/CLASS_PLAYTEST_VALIDATION.json');test('Existing17-class validation remains passing separate from balance',cmanifest['status']=='PASS' and cmanifest['classes']==17 and c['status']=='provisional-card-draft-not-balance-approved')
    covered_ids={r['id'] for r in c['cards']};test('Explicit18 cross-system cases retain unique identities',len(CASES)==18 and len({r[0] for r in CASES})==18)
    protected=dict(read(AUDIT/'CRAFTING_FEAT_INTERFACE_PREPARATION.json')['protectedFiles'])
    test('All63 preceding protected inputs unchanged',len(protected)==63 and all(sha(GAME/p)==h for p,h in protected.items()))
    for p in [classpath,guidepath,extractpath,bookpath,ROOT/'docs/mechanics/CLASS_PLAYTEST_RULES.md',ROOT/'docs/mechanics/CLASS_PLAYTEST_VALIDATION.json',AUDIT/'ADVANCED_CRAFT_SOURCE_PREPARATION.json']:
        protected[p.relative_to(GAME).as_posix()]=sha(p)
    assert all(c['pass'] for c in check),[c['name'] for c in check if not c['pass']]
    e={'status':'Prepared-only;not sent;no class orcraft rule changed','classCandidate':c,'classCandidateFile':classpath.relative_to(GAME).as_posix(),'classCandidateSha256':sha(classpath),'classGuideFile':guidepath.relative_to(GAME).as_posix(),'classGuideSha256':sha(guidepath),'originalClassExtract':extract,'classExtractFile':extractpath.relative_to(GAME).as_posix(),'classExtractSha256':sha(extractpath),'underlyingBookFile':bookpath.relative_to(GAME).as_posix(),'underlyingBookSha256':sha(bookpath),'craftedRecipeIds':[r['id'] for r in recipes],'craftedSourceFile':sourcepath.relative_to(GAME).as_posix(),'craftedSourceSha256':sha(sourcepath),'completeCraftedSourceEvidence':'docs/audit/2026-10-08/full-game/ADVANCED_CRAFT_SOURCE_PREPARATION.json','craftedSourceEvidenceSha256':sha(AUDIT/'ADVANCED_CRAFT_SOURCE_PREPARATION.json'),'cases':[{'id':id,'topic':topic,'question':question} for id,topic,question in CASES],'checks':check,'protectedFiles':protected,'scope':'All48 authored class cards and210original lines preserved alongside43 separately pending crafting identities; source matching does not approve cross-system eligibility.','recipesApproved':0,'classRulesChanged':0,'sourceInformationDeleted':0,'cosmology':'Existing literal names/prohibitions preserved; no interpretation before successful authorized push and verified remote commit.'}
    create(out,json.dumps(e,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
    md=['# Tinker class andcrafted devices — interface preparation','',f'Internal preparation only. All48 authored class cards,eight engine paragraphs and210 indexed original book lines remain preserved. All43 Tinkering formulas remain separately unreviewed. {len(check)} checks pass. The existing class packet remains provisional andnot human-balance-approved; this audit supplies no new gameplay permissions.','',
      'The class already defines automatic Anacite ownership,command budgets,caps,repair,modules andtemporary devices. Crafted formulas have their own AC/HP/charge/servicing fields andunfinished actions. One source cannot silently fill the other merely because it uses drone,construct,device orrepair.','',
      '| Case | Question for joint review |','|---|---|']
    for id,topic,q in CASES:md.append('| '+id+' — '+topic+' | '+q+' |')
    md +=['','The [complete evidence](TINKER_DEVICE_INTERFACE_PREPARATION.json) preserves full class JSON andoriginal extract,hashes both,the underlying book andall indexed lines,andlinks the complete43 crafting originals already prepared. No source,rule,command budget,resource orcrafted output is changed.','',
      'The complete class-context packet is unsent. A future conference must include the actual then-current shared rules andcomplete Tinkering source packet; this context is not enough by itself to approve either the43 recipe cards ornew cross-system eligibility. The active Tailoring request must finish first.','']
    create(notes,'\n'.join(md))
    prompt='PREPARED TINKER CLASS/CRAFTED DEVICE CONTEXT — NOT SENT. This is one side of a future cross-system conference; pair with CODEX_ADVANCED_CRAFT_TINKERING_PREPARED.txt,its shared interfaces,andthen-current reviewed rules. No inference about source-only recipes orcosmology is authorized.\n\n'+notes.read_text(encoding='utf-8')+'\n\nFULL PRESERVED CLASS ANDSOURCE EXTRACT\n'+json.dumps({k:v for k,v in e.items() if k!='protectedFiles'},ensure_ascii=False,separators=(',',':'))+'\n\nCOMPLETE CURRENT CLASS GUIDE\n'+guide+'\n\nCOMPLETE CURRENT SHARED CLASS RULES\n'+(ROOT/'docs/mechanics/CLASS_PLAYTEST_RULES.md').read_text(encoding='utf-8')
    create(packet,prompt);status={'status':'Prepared-not-sent;no new class/recipe approval','packetFile':packet.name,'characters':len(prompt),'sha256':sha(packet),'classCards':48,'originalIndexedBookLines':210,'pendingCraftRecipes':43,'cases':18,'checks':len(check),'protectedFiles':len(protected),'classRulesChanged':0,'recipesApproved':0};create(AUDIT/'TINKER_DEVICE_INTERFACE_STATUS.json',json.dumps(status,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n');print(json.dumps(status))
if __name__=='__main__':main()
